<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Holliday returns five days after his last dose. He completed all 182 doses by video-observed therapy: 56 in the intensive phase and 126 in the continuation phase, with the one dose held during the stomach illness in the spring added at the end. The cultures from the third week and from the two-month visit both grew nothing, so the continuation phase stayed at four months. He has had no cough, fever, night sweats, or weight loss for months, and he has gained 7.5 kg. The repeat liver tests planned two weeks after the sick visit, and the monthly tests in the fourth and fifth months, were not drawn; he reported no hepatitis symptoms on any video call. Since the party in the spring he has had a drink or two at most once a week and no heavy drinking. He sees his counselor once a month. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Treatment</td><td>All 182 doses completed by video-observed therapy</td></tr><tr><td>Cultures</td><td>Third-week and two-month cultures negative</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>65.5 kg, up 7.5 kg since diagnosis</td></tr><tr><td>Alcohol</td><td>AUDIT-C 3; no heavy drinking since the spring</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

